# AI Alchemy Coding Standards

This rule file points to `packs/ai-alchemy-standards/RULES.md`.

**Primary source**: If this repo has an `AGENTS.md`, follow it. Otherwise, refer to `~/.aialchemylabs/packs/ai-alchemy-standards/RULES.md` or the installed packs.

**Key points**:
- Feature-first organization (not by file type)
- Strict type safety and runtime validation at boundaries
- Small, verifiable changes
- Tests required for new features and bug fixes
- No secrets in code/logs/docs

See `packs/ai-alchemy-standards/RULES.md` for full standards.
